TITLE Mix DIC and Ca solutions 1:1 and heat to 200C with calcite equilibration
SOLUTION 1 DIC_solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50 mmol/kgw
    units mmol/kgw
SOLUTION 2 Ca_solution
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol/kgw
    units mmol/kgw

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 40 60 80 100 120 140 160 180 200

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_calcite_heat.sel
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -si Calcite
END
